      "created_at": "2014-04-28T17:45:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What Humble-Knight said; it's not destroying a card, it's removing it from play. The 'Indestructible' keyword has a clause stating they cannot be removed from play, but on-destruction effects don't activate.</p>",
